  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">• About our brand and products:<br>• What makes us different:&nbsp;</p><ul><li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1033\" id=\"isPasted\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1033\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"940\">Curated Tech Only:</strong> We don’t list random gadgets — we handpick items that are <em data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1030\">tested, modern, and in demand</em>.</p></li><li data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1154\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1154\"><strong data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1074\">Caribbean-Inspired, Global Appeal:</strong> We infuse island energy and creativity into a sleek, international tech vibe.</p></li><li data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1284\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1284\"><strong data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1186\">Fast, Reliable Suppliers:</strong> All our products are sourced from verified suppliers with quality control and tracking support.</p></li><li data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1378\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1378\"><strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1315\">Friendly, Local Service:</strong> Real customer support that actually responds</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1608\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Affiliates earn <strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1529\">up to 15% commission</strong> on every sale generated through their unique referral link or discount code.</span></p><ul data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1909\"><li data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1693\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1693\">Earn on <strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1637\">every purchase</strong> made by customers you refer (not just the first one).</p></li><li data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1750\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1750\"><strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1707\">Bonuses</strong> available for top performers each month.</p></li><li data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1833\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1833\"><strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1764\">Payouts</strong> are made via PayPal, bank transfer, or store credit — your choice.</p></li><li data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1909\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1909\">Real-time <strong data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1869\">affiliate dashboard</strong> to track clicks, sales, and earnings.</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• How to promote us:&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2126\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">We encourage affiliates to promote our products creatively and authentically. You can:</span></p><ul data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2505\"><li data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2233\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2233\">Post <strong data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2153\">unboxing videos</strong> or <strong data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2171\">tech demos</strong> on <strong data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2185\">TikTok</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2200\">Instagram</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2213\">YouTube</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2230\">Facebook</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2326\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2326\">Write <strong data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2261\">product reviews</strong> or <strong data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2287\">“Top 5 Tech Finds”</strong> blog posts with your affiliate link.</p></li><li data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2405\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><p data-start=